## Camping pitches

Skorovas Camping has two areas: Kleiva and Sletta. Sletta is beside lake Lisskorovatnet. Both areas offer pitches for motorhomes and caravans with electricity and toilet access. Tents are also welcome by the lake. The shop and Skjenkestova pub are nearby.

## Prices

- Motorhome or caravan at Kleiva: **NOK 350 per day**, including electricity and toilet access.
- Motorhome or caravan at Sletta: **NOK 400 per day**, including electricity and toilet access.
- Tent: **NOK 100 per day**, including toilet access.

## Facilities

Water and toilets are available at Gruvekafeen inside the shop. The shower in the community building is currently unavailable. Recycling containers are located at the campsite, and a free grey-water and toilet disposal point is just under one kilometre west of the site. Skorovas samvirkelag SA operates the campsite. Use “Book a pitch” to book through Campio. For questions about your stay, contact **booking@skorovascamping.no**.
